{"run_id": "89ea27b06704441ab9d0e3f724cb7682", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:17.997485+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "p04-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c015", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r015", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 479.1171875, 203.25, 490.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 505.9765625, 541.5, 533.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 549.9765625, 546.75, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露\n\n如果误把验证码发给他人、发现本人未发起的验证请求或看到异常登录提示，应停止相关操作并通过企业确认的渠道报告。不要继续向未知联系人提供新的验证码，也不要按陌生消息要求安装不明远程控制软件。\n\n本文仅给出报告原则，不规定账号冻结权限、密码重置步骤或安全事件分级。具体处置需查阅账号与安全事件制度。VPN连接成功不代表某条外部消息可信", "rrf_score": 0.031545, "bm25_score": 3.863421, "vector_score": 0.594619}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c008", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r008", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第八节 结束使用"], "token_count": 125, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 547.6171875, 134.25, 559.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 574.4765625, 541.5, 602.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第八节 结束使用\n\n完成远程工作后，应按客户端提供的方式断开连接，确认不再需要访问内部资源。不要把长期保持连接当成获得持续授权的证明。本文未规定自动断开时长或并发设备数量，这些限制需要查询具体服务配置。", "rrf_score": 0.031514, "bm25_score": 5.377243, "vector_score": 0.557718}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c009", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r009", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第九节 优先检查网络和验证码"], "token_count": 241, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 203.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第九节 优先检查网络和验证码\n\nVPN连接失败时，先检查网络与验证码有效性；仍失败应联系IT服务台，不要向他人分享验证码。排查时先确认基础网络可用，再核对企业账号、当前验证码和客户端提示。应一次记录一个明确现象，避免同时修改多项配置后无法确定原因。\n\n网络切换、设备休眠恢复或临时断网可能使连接状态变化。重新连接前应先查看客户端当前状态，不要同时开启多个来源不", "rrf_score": 0.030159, "bm25_score": 2.709056, "vector_score": 0.568195}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c007", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r007", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第七节 确认网络与业务访问"], "token_count": 221, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 426.6171875, 191.75, 438.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 453.4765625, 546.75, 481.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 497.4765625, 546.75, 525.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第七节 确认网络与业务访问\n\nVPN显示已连接但目标系统无法打开时，应记录目标系统名称、错误提示和发生时间。可以区分为网页无法访问、页面能够打开但登录失败、登录后缺少某项业务功能等不同现象，便于确认网络和业务权限问题。\n\n不应把“没有导出权限”等业务角色限制理解为VPN故障。例如某产品功能仅管理员可用时，网络连通并不能替代角色授权。相关产品权限应查阅对应产品", "rrf_score": 0.02971, "bm25_score": 2.498698, "vector_score": 0.557818}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 186.0, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围\n\n员工在公司外访问内部系统时，需要使用企业VPN。企业VPN用于建立访问内部资源所需的网络连接；连接成功不代表自动获得每个系统的业务权限。用户仍需满足目标系统的账号、角色与授权要求。本文仅适用于企业员工的接入流程。\n\n本指南不规定个人设备准入、海外网络接入、承包商访问或其他远程访问产品的使用办法。若使用环境属于上述情况，应补充相", "rrf_score": 0.016393, "bm25_score": 6.844021, "vector_score": 0.479275}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c019", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r019", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十九节 使用前后检查清单"], "token_count": 247, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 461.6171875, 191.75, 473.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 488.4765625, 541.5, 533.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 549.9765625, 541.5, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十九节 使用前后检查清单\n\n使用前核对：本人账号、已获批并开通、企业确认的客户端、可用的基础网络和当前验证码。登录后核对：客户端状态、目标系统可达性、本人业务角色及错误提示。离开时核对：是否已经完成工作、是否需要断开连接、是否遗留含敏感信息的截图。\n\n提交故障时核对：问题发生的具体步骤、时间、可复现现象、网络类型、目标系统及已尝试步骤；再次检查附件没有密码", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 2.071403, "vector_score": 0.571761}]}}
